request.problem:
(本题满分10分)选修4-5:不等式选讲.已知函数$f\left( x \right)=\left| x-1 \right|+\left| x-a \right|.$
(1)若$a=2$,解不等式$f\left( x \right)\ge 2$;
(2)若$a>1,\forall x\in R$,$f\left( x \right)+\left| x-1 \right|\ge 1$,求实数$a$的取值范围.

